+
+Every one of the four opens with the same two **absolutely stated** preservation conjuncts. They are
+the part that needs no argument the artifact fails to pin, and — unlike a read-family `LeafFrame` —
+there is no `NoAllocation` among them for the three allocating routines, because those three
+allocate. -/
