+/-- **`postOptionalU64`'s three record-independent conjuncts.** Unlike the two allocating decoders it
+also denies allocation, which is decidable without any argument at all. -/
+def postOptionalU64CheckedB (env : DecoderEnvironment) (args : SliceToResultArgs)
+    (before after : State) : Bool :=
