+/-- **Each constant-thunk mirror is shown both firing and passing.** On the allocating pair
+`postAllocatorFree` fires `NoAllocation`; on the thunk's own quiet pair it reports no failure, and a
+hand-made `.error` fires the result clause. `postAllocatorResize` fires `x10 = 0` on the quiet pair
