+The family agent reported column 2 as `ok@witness-args`. It is a gap here. Row A binds `dst`/`src`/`n`
+to `x10`/`x11`/`x12` — the very registers `preCopy` constrains — so all three register conjuncts are
+`x == x`, and `MemoryBytes(source)` and `contents.size=length` are witness-constructed on top of
+that. Five of six conjuncts unfalsifiable is not a pass, whatever marker it is printed with.
