+Column 4 **is** a pass, and it is the one place in this module where the word is used at full
+strength: `postCopyCheckedB_iff_postCopy` is an equivalence rather than a one-way mirror, so a clean
+run of the mirror gives the real `postCopy`. `copy_post_result_clause_is_not_vacuous` shows the
+destination did not already hold the copied bytes, and `copy_post_check_flips_on_every_conjunct`
+exhibits every conjunct firing.
