+/-- **The three `preCopy` register conjuncts hold, and the printed pairs show why they could not have
+done otherwise.** Row A's value and the register value coincide *exactly* at all six places, because
+Row A's binding kind is `reg` at the very register the conjunct names. This theorem is here to make
