+/-! ### Anti-vacuity for the copy family
+
+Every conjunct the two rows pass is exhibited failing on a counterfactual built from the same
+captured states. Nothing below is a run: each is a hand-edited state or a hand-edited argument
+record, and the unmutated case is always printed beside it. -/
