+    copyPreMutations? = some (none,
+      some "preCopy.x10=destination",
+      some "preCopy.x11=source",
+      some "preCopy.x12=length",
+      some "preCopy.CodeIntact",
+      some "preCopy.MemoryBytes(source)",
+      some "preCopy.contents.size=length") := by native_decide
+
+/-- A counterfactual **call**, not a counterfactual predicate: `a0` really holds `source + 1`, and the
+argument record agrees with it, so every `preCopy` conjunct still holds and the only clause that can
+speak is `memcpy`'s non-overlap disjunct. The same call is then offered to `memmove`'s precondition,
+which does not carry that disjunct. -/
