+  the copied bytes are not at that code address;
+* deliver them there and the *same* postcondition fails `postCopy.CodeIntact(after)` instead, because
+  the file bytes no longer match memory (`codeIntactB = false`) — and the result clause now holds
+  (`memoryBytesB = true`), so the two clauses are being satisfied alternately and never together.
