+and 126 from `gap(tag … is outside the checked read family)` to *evaluated*. **Nothing refutes.**
+Every conjunct the mirrors reach holds on the real captured states, and every conjunct they do not
+reach is named in the row's gap text. Column 4 is unchanged at 0 ok / 10 violated; column 2 is
+unchanged at 2 ok / 100 violated; only column 5 moves, 104 → 108 ok, because these four now have a
+`stepBound` at all.
