+* **The harness slice cap.** `x11 = 16` at index 134, far under `maximumSliceBytes`, so the
+  "x11 exceeds the slice cap" gap is likewise not exercised.
+* **`postCanonicalOffsetsFailure?` is not on the harness path at all.** It needs a `result`, and the
