+  local obligation is vacuously satisfiable at that state and nothing column 4 reports about this row
+  — gap or otherwise — is evidence against the contract. Column 4 is evaluated independently of
+  column 2 throughout this module, which is the same convention the read family uses; it is recorded
+  rather than silently relied on. -/
 
